OL,3,GNEWSAMedal gifted anonymously to
OL,4,ABradley Lowery charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medal marking Coventry City's 1987 FA
OL,7,FCup win over Tottenham Hotspur has been
OL,8,Fdonated anonymously to the Bradley
OL,9,FLowery Foundation.
OL,11,FThe charity said that it came from an
OL,12,Funnamed Coventry fan following an
OL,13,Fincident in which a 14-year-old was
OL,14,Fbailed by police after allegedly
OL,15,Ftaunting Sunderland fans with an image
OL,16,Fof Bradley, a young supporter who died
OL,17,Faged six from a rare cancer in 2017.
OL,19,FIt was sent to Bradley's parents, Gemma
OL,20,Fand Carl, in a presentation box with a
OL,21,Fhandwritten letter from the supporter.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
