OL,3,GNEWSAMedal gifted anonymously to
OL,4,ABradley Lowery charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Kenny Jones, who runs Football
OL,7,FHistorian said: "One [person] doesn't
OL,8,Frepresent a fan base. I think the way
OL,9,Fthe whole club's come together, is a
OL,10,Fgreat example of what football can do."
